==English==

===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia|Ural-Altaic languages}}
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[grouping]] of the [[Uralic]] language family with the [[Altaic]] languages, formerly considered a [[language family]], now treated as an area of linguistic convergence, or possibly a ''[[sprachbund]]'' (like Altaic itself).

